    "detailed_description": "The ancient land was in turmoil, and the root of all this was because of the evil tower.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn order to save the world, countless monks decided to go down the mountain and flatten the pagoda named &quot;Taoyao&quot;, and return a jade to the world. And you are the one with the most potential.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTaoYaoTa is a hardcore luck tower climbing game. Strategy and luck will determine the course of your adventure as you play an immortalizer who kills demons and saves the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will encounter a total of 9 levels of TaoYaoTa, each level of 9 short stages of adventure, every exploration in the tower will affect your life or death.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game uses an automatic save mechanic, which is saved before each exploration.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will fight with many monsters in Pagoda, and you may encounter strange animals from ancient times, such as captive ox and phoenix.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVirtue items, weapons, armor, everything you collect in the tower will show up on you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTaoYaoTa is a Roguelike game. When your character dies, your last play is recorded and you start again with your character.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTaoYaoTa is powered by RPGMakerMV. We show you the new possibilities of RPGMaker through this lightweight work.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is the seventh game of the SleepAllday studio, and the second game under the leadership of Taoyao.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope you enjoy the game.",
    "about_the_game": "The ancient land was in turmoil, and the root of all this was because of the evil tower.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn order to save the world, countless monks decided to go down the mountain and flatten the pagoda named &quot;Taoyao&quot;, and return a jade to the world. And you are the one with the most potential.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTaoYaoTa is a hardcore luck tower climbing game. Strategy and luck will determine the course of your adventure as you play an immortalizer who kills demons and saves the world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will encounter a total of 9 levels of TaoYaoTa, each level of 9 short stages of adventure, every exploration in the tower will affect your life or death.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game uses an automatic save mechanic, which is saved before each exploration.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will fight with many monsters in Pagoda, and you may encounter strange animals from ancient times, such as captive ox and phoenix.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVirtue items, weapons, armor, everything you collect in the tower will show up on you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTaoYaoTa is a Roguelike game. When your character dies, your last play is recorded and you start again with your character.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTaoYaoTa is powered by RPGMakerMV. We show you the new possibilities of RPGMaker through this lightweight work.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is the seventh game of the SleepAllday studio, and the second game under the leadership of Taoyao.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope you enjoy the game.",
